  "help.blockTitle": "Block project",
  "help.blockBody": "With a project selected, Block project (freeze) stops the scheduler from starting new tasks in that project only. Running tasks continue. Pause is a softer variant. This is different from the idle “FROZEN” badge on a running card (no recent log output).",
